---
/**
 * TODO(thanos): confirm the operating entity and governing law before launch.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'

const updated = '9 August 2026'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="The terms covering use of the Total Football website and its content."
  path="/terms/"
>
  <div class="shell max-w-prose py-20 md:py-28">
    <p class="micro mb-6">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="text-title font-black">Terms</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-faint">Last updated {updated}</p>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-10 text-[16px] leading-[1.75] text-ink/85">
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-black text-ink">Use of the site</h2>
        <p>
          The site is provided as it is, for information. We try to keep it accurate and available
          but do not guarantee either.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-black text-ink">Content and copyright</h2>
        <p>
          The diagrams, animations and written explanations here are original works and remain our
          property. You are welcome to quote from them and to link to them, with attribution. You may
          not rehost the diagrams, present the material as your own, or republish it commercially
          without permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-black text-ink">Tactical content</h2>
        <p>
          The breakdowns are interpretations, produced for teaching. Real matches contain detail no
          diagram captures, and reasonable coaches disagree. Nothing here is affiliated with, endorsed
          by, or produced in cooperation with any club, federation or competition, and club and
          national-team names are used descriptively only.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-black text-ink">Total Stats and betting content</h2>
        <p>
          The Intelligence section describes a statistical model and publishes its record. It is
          information and entertainment, not financial, investment or betting advice, and not a
          recommendation to stake money. No outcome is guaranteed. Gambling involves a risk of loss
          and can be addictive. You must be 18 or over, and it is your responsibility to know the law
          where you live. We accept no liability for losses arising from decisions you make.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-black text-ink">Third-party links</h2>
        <p>
          We link to external services such as Telegram and social platforms. We do not control them
          and are not responsible for their content or their terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-black text-ink">Changes</h2>
        <p>
          These terms may be updated. The date at the top always reflects the current version.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
